        description  = 'Mission Orders: A distraught Cait Sith has enlisted your help to recover the punch bug, an indispensable little critter that escaped her grasp in a moment of distraction. Your best bet is to search for it in dark, damp places. Cramped, moist environs.',
        series       = 'Wings of the Goddess',
        previous     = '',
        next         = '',
        walkthrough  = {
            { 'Trade a Punch Bug to the Veridical Conflux in Grauberg (S) at (F-5) for a cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'Punch Bugs drop from Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Gold Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs in Pashhow Marshlands (S); and Ancient Quadavs, Gold Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs in Beadeaux (S).' },
            } },
            { 'You will obtain a Key Item Bottled punch bug after trading with the Veridical Conflux.', sub = {
                { 'The C.A (Campaign Arbiter) Warp will bring you closest to reach Witchfire Glen for this objective if you have little to no progress with Voidwatch.' },
