        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Lying in wait in the castle\'s innermost chambers was not a generous jackpot, but a chilling confrontation! With a malevolent moogle poised to unravel not merely Mog House tradition but the very fabric of the universe, only our heroes can stand in his way!',
