        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'Hope for the Future',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Balamor reveals that Hades is the ringleader behind this foul plot, and that defeating him will remove the curse afflicting so many Adoulinians. Before marching into his throne room in Ra\'Kaznar Turris, however, it might be best to visit Castle Adoulin.',
