        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Gilgamesh claims that he chanced upon a young woman while sailing the stormy western seas, and wants you to meet her in Norg. Speak to his crew when you are ready to leave, but those with Gilgamesh\'s letter of introduction should use it first.',
