        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: The world has rejected Iroha\'s presence, but Alexander believes Cait Sith might have an answer. Cavernous maws in either Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign may enable you to meet with the enigmatic feline.',
