        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Only Altana can make Vana\'diel accept Iroha\'s presence in this world, and the first step to reaching her is to cull the threats that Vana\'diel faces. Continue with the Wings of the Goddess missions if you have not met Lilisette.',
