        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Though you have met Lilisette, she has no idea how to meet Altana. On the bright side, your orb has been granted another spark of light. Cait Sith has beseeched you for aid, saying that the ambassador has infiltrated the Walk of Echoes.',
