        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Gilgamesh seemed skittish about a new vortex to Escha that opened in Misareaux Coast. Iroha journeyed there alone, seemingly preferring to travel on her own. Head to Misareaux Coast and see what you can learn.',
