        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: The threat to Valhalla and Vana\'diel has finally been vanquished, and beastmen and the enlightened races alike can walk hand in hand to secure a brighter future for all. Your choice has brought new light to the land.',
