        walkthrough  = {
            { 'You begin at (I-9) as do all 20 Conies. Shortly after the Assault begins they will split and start moving either north or south.' },
            { 'Sometimes the Conies will run away while engaged, eventually losing aggro. Note that if they run past other Conies they will link. If a Coney runs away and loses aggro, if left unclaimed they will recover to full HP.' },
            { 'It is recommended to wait a few minutes after the Assault begins to allow the Conies to spread out and avoid a mass link.' },
            { 'Once a Coney reaches a vegetation they will eat it until it disappears. The Assault is automatically failed if too much vegetation is eaten.' },
