        assault_rank = 'Private First Class',
        time_limit   = '30 minutes',
        mission_orders = 'Eliminate Lamia No.13',
        recommended_lv = 'Lvl. 70',
        walkthrough  = {
            { 'In this Assault, you start at I-8 with your goal to defeat a RNG-type Lamia NM named Lamia No. 13. She is located in the northern part of the map, and assisted by 3 NPCs that she has charmed, which must be dealt with if you are to succeed.' },
            { 'The most popular strategy is to bring 2-3 jobs that are capable of Dispelling the Charmed status from the NPCs, as they will then join your efforts to defeat the Lamia. Jobs that are capable of Dispelling Charm include RDM, BRD, COR, SMN and BLU. In addition, due to the innate accuracy of the Dispel (or Finale) spells, players level 64 (or 66) and higher may sub RDM (or BRD) for the ability to Dispel.' },
            { 'Lamia No. 13 will use Belly Dance often, re-Charming those in range, so players must be ready to Dispel again.' },
